        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二、建议、提案</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #d9d9d9;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 700px;\n    min-height: 900px;\n    margin: 20px auto;\n    background: #f0eee6;\n    padding: 40px 50px 40px 40px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .side-strip {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .side-strip div {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    margin: 10px 0 25px 0;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  p.intro {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0 0 25px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .format-label {\n    color: #d4622a;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 20px 0 15px 0;\n  }\n  .doc-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .doc-subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n  }\n  .leader-line {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #111;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 15px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .body-text {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .blue {\n    color: #3b6fc4;\n  }\n  .black {\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .list-line {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 2.2;\n    color: #111;\n    margin-left: 2.5em;\n  }\n  .signature-block {\n    margin-top: 40px;\n    text-align: right;\n    padding-right: 40px;\n  }\n  .signature-block .org {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n  .signature-block .date {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">二、建议、提案</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"intro\">\n    建议是指下级部门因某个重要事项的解决，需要向上\n    级提出解决问题想法的文体。具体写作技巧包括以下几\n    个方面。提案一般为政协提案，具体格式见示例。\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"format-label\">格式：</div>\n\n  <div class=\"doc-title\">关于 xxxxx 的建议</div>\n  <div class=\"doc-subtitle\">（\"发文机关+关于+内容+文种\"）</div>\n\n  <div class=\"leader-line\">各级领导（称谓要根据具体题目要求分析得出）：</div>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text indent\">\n    <span class=\"black\">当前，…等问题比较突出（或做了什么工作），为了</span><br>\n    <span class=\"black\">做好……工作，提出以下建议：</span><span class=\"blue\">（开头为背景分析，指出存</span><br>\n    <span class=\"blue\">在的主要问题和目的意义）</span>\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"list-line black\">一、…..</div>\n  <div class=\"list-line black\">二、…..</div>\n  <div class=\"list-line\">\n    <span class=\"black\">三、……</span><span class=\"blue\">（主体内容还厚为对策题，提出解决问题的措</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"list-line blue\" style=\"margin-left:0;\">施）</div>\n\n  <div class=\"signature-block\">\n    <div class=\"org\">发文机关</div>\n    <div class=\"date\">xx 年 xx 月 xX 日</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"side-strip\">\n    <div style=\"background:#e6c84f;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"background:#e07b39;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"background:#6fae7c;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"background:#4f9ab8;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"background:#e6c84f;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"background:#a0c15a;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"background:#e07b39;\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
